{
    "name": "戶外活動",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，<br>討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！"
            },
            {
                "text": "Mayaw, pilipayan no dafak, o tatalacowa kiso?",
                "textCh": "Mayaw，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65819/919692",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Tala’alo kako ato ci Iko a mi’id’id to titi anodafak, kiso ka?",
                "textCh": "我明天要和Iko去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65819/919693",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Tengil han fangcal a salamaen ! manga’ay mihakelong kako a tayra?",
                "textCh": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65819/919694",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Licayen ho ci ina iso!",
                "textCh": "你先問媽媽！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65819/919695",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Inaaw, manga’ay mitoor kako ci kakaan a tayra i ’alo?",
                "textCh": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65819/919696",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Hayda, nika pina’on kamo yo!",
                "textCh": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65819/919697",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-3.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Hai, mafana’ to kami!",
                "textCh": "沒問題，我們一定會的！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65819/919698",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            }
        ],
